Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sunday morning and fafda-jalebi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:06.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,Salty and sweet on one plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:09.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Where did this pair come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.60,0:00:14.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fafda is made from gram flour, ajwain and salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.23,0:00:16.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,It comes with fried green chillies,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:19.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,raw papaya sambharo and chutney.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.45,0:00:23.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,The pair became famous through Dussehra.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.64,0:00:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,For many Gujarati families,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:29.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,fafda-jalebi on Dussehra morning is a yearly ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:34.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Folklore says Lord Ram loved jalebi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.06,0:00:37.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,and Hanuman loved gram-flour dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:39.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Many believe the Navratri fast
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.67,0:00:42.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,is best broken with gram flour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.35,0:00:46.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,So on Dussehra morning, long queues form
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.40,0:00:47.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,outside farsan shops,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.01,0:00:50.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,some starting as early as 4 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And on other days, it's still a favourite breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:57.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you want with your fafda:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.15,0:01:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,chillies or sambharo? Tell us in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.25,0:01:04.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stories of Gujarat, on the otlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.20,0:01:05.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow Otlo.
